(1, 1, 'What is the primary difference between trading and investing?', 'Trading involves higher amounts of money', 'Trading focuses on short-term price movements for profit', 'Investing is only for professionals', 'There is no difference', 'B', 'Trading focuses on short-term price movements to generate profit, while investing typically involves longer-term positions for growth.'),
